Usage: nexo [flags] <command> [args]

Commands:
  agents    List agent panes, or run the backend watcher.
  backend   Print the selected backend and its capabilities.
  clone     Clone a repository with Git.
  delete    Preflight and delete a project candidate.
  focus     Record a container focus event from the backend.
  list      List configured project candidates.
  open      Open a discovered project candidate.
  previous  Open the last non-proxy local container.
  remote    List and operate on containers on remote machines.
  tmux      Install and control the tmux adapter.
  tui       Open the tabbed terminal UI.
  worktree  Create or extract Git worktrees.

Global flags:
  --backend auto|tmux|herdr  Select the backend (default: auto-detect).
  --json                     Write structured output where supported.
  --version                  Print the nexo version.
  -c, --config-file PATH     Read configuration from PATH.
  -h, --help                 Show help for this command.

Run 'nexo <command> --help' for more.
